OL,3,GNEWSAOzzy's final performance set for
OL,4,Acinemas
OL,5,
OL,6,FOzzy Osbourne's final ever performance
OL,7,Fwith Black Sabbath, filmed just 17 days
OL,8,Fbefore his death, is set to be shown in
OL,9,Fcinemas.
OL,11,FThe Birmingham-born star, known as the
OL,12,FPrince of Darkness, died aged 76 in
OL,13,FJuly 2025, after Sabbath's Back To The
OL,14,FBeginning farewell concert, where he
OL,15,Fwas reunited in the city with his
OL,16,Fbandmates for the first time in 20
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
