OL,3,GNEWSAOzzy's final performance set for
OL,4,Acinemas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe show, which saw them joined by an
OL,7,Farray of metal artists who regard them
OL,8,Fas heroes including Metallica, Guns 'n'
OL,9,FRoses and Anthrax, gets a worldwide
OL,10,Fcinema release on 28 October.
OL,12,FOzzy & Black Sabbath: Back To The
OL,13,FBeginning captures Osbourne with the
OL,14,Fband's original line-up, guitarist Tony
OL,15,FIommi, bassist Geezer Butler and
OL,16,Fdrummer Bill Ward.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
